<!-- NOTE: cargo-bundle splices this file verbatim into the middle of the <dict> it
     generates. It is therefore a BARE FRAGMENT of key/value pairs: adding an XML
     declaration, a DOCTYPE, or <plist>/<dict> wrappers here nests a second document
     inside the first and produces an Info.plist macOS cannot parse, which makes the
     app fail to launch. Do not "fix" this into a complete plist.
     Keys cargo-bundle already emits (CFBundle*, LSMinimumSystemVersion,
     LSApplicationCategoryType, NSHighResolutionCapable) must not be repeated. -->

<!-- Shown in the macOS microphone permission prompt. Without this key the process
     is denied access to the microphone, often silently, and cannot record at all. -->
<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
<string>syncrec needs the microphone to record audio from your selected input device.</string>
